[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11580.63, "timestamp": "03:13:00", "text": "私の側のコンテンツに関しては"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11583.91, "timestamp": "03:13:03", "text": "私のコンテンツ側としては、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11587.269, "timestamp": "03:13:07", "text": "目標がないことは既に述べました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11591.349, "timestamp": "03:13:11", "text": "Twitchの右目標のために私にとって左へ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11592.95, "timestamp": "03:13:12", "text": "意味"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11596.95, "timestamp": "03:13:16", "text": "大きな理由、主な理由、なぜ私は疑問に思うのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11600.63, "timestamp": "03:13:20", "text": "Twitchで配信された"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11604.23, "timestamp": "03:13:24", "text": "最初は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11608.309, "timestamp": "03:13:28", "text": "それって何？えーと、最初はどこだったかな、だって私はえーと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11610.389, "timestamp": "03:13:30", "text": "Twitchにすごく魅了されている。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11612.309, "timestamp": "03:13:32", "text": "いろいろなことについて配信者になりたかったのですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11614.09, "timestamp": "03:13:34", "text": "アフィリエイトになった後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11616.07, "timestamp": "03:13:36", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11619.19, "timestamp": "03:13:39", "text": "そして私はそれをある程度理解しました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11621.67, "timestamp": "03:13:41", "text": "YouTubeも同じですよね？わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11623.99, "timestamp": "03:13:43", "text": "例えば、提携したり何かしたりすると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11625.99, "timestamp": "03:13:45", "text": "右？収益化が実現したら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11628.309, "timestamp": "03:13:48", "text": "もの。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11630.389, "timestamp": "03:13:50", "text": "えっと、Twitchに関しては、私が思うに唯一のことは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11633.03, "timestamp": "03:13:53", "text": "私は自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11637.11, "timestamp": "03:13:57", "text": "提携プロセスは提携でした"}]